WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.862
Hello! I am a baby elephant.

2
00:00:03.863 --> 00:00:09.903
When I was only three days old, I began to walk.

3
00:00:09.904 --> 00:00:12.978
I like to eat all kinds of plants.

4
00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:16.060
I like to eat fruit and bark too.

5
00:00:16.061 --> 00:00:19.963
But I do not eat meat.

6
00:00:19.964 --> 00:00:22.396
Let me show you how I eat.

7
00:00:22.397 --> 00:00:26.634
I use my long trunk to pick up food.

8
00:00:26.635 --> 00:00:31.154
I use my trunk to breathe and smell too.

9
00:00:31.155 --> 00:00:34.808
I use my trunk to spray water on my body.

10
00:00:34.809 --> 00:00:39.560
I can take a bath using my trunk! Splash!

11
00:00:39.561 --> 00:00:43.278
I use my trunk to throw dust all over my body.

12
00:00:43.279 --> 00:00:45.456
Doesn’t it look fun?

13
00:00:45.457 --> 00:00:49.434
There is another kind of bath I like too.

14
00:00:49.435 --> 00:00:52.456
I like to take a mud bath.

15
00:00:52.457 --> 00:00:57.019
Rolling in the mud is fun! Whee!

16
00:00:57.020 --> 00:01:00.597
Oh! It is so hot today.

17
00:01:00.598 --> 00:01:06.383
I can flap my large ears to cool off my body. Ahh!

18
00:01:06.384 --> 00:01:13.667
I also flap my ears to chase the flies away. Shoo!

19
00:01:13.668 --> 00:01:17.678
I can do so many things with my ears and trunk!

20
00:01:17.679 --> 00:01:22.578
But there is one thing I cannot do. Jump!

21
00:01:22.579 --> 00:01:26.476
The elephant is the only mammal that cannot jump.

22
00:01:26.477 --> 00:01:28.168
But that's okay.

23
00:01:28.169 --> 00:01:31.715
I can walk faster than people!

24
00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:33.765
Do you see my dad?

25
00:01:33.766 --> 00:01:36.338
He has something I don’t have yet.

26
00:01:36.339 --> 00:01:39.435
Look at his tusks!

27
00:01:39.436 --> 00:01:43.184
I wish I had huge tusks like my dad.

28
00:01:43.185 --> 00:01:46.227
I think they look wonderful.

29
00:01:46.228 --> 00:01:51.269
Dad says that someday I will have huge tusks too.

30
00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:53.285
But I will have to wait.

31
00:01:53.286 --> 00:01:59.911
When I grow up, I will look just like him!

